  "property_name": "robocrys",
  "description": "Na₂NiO₂ is Ilmenite-like structured and crystallizes in the orthorhombic Immm space group. Na is bonded to four equivalent O atoms to form a mixture of distorted corner and edge-sharing NaO₄ trigonal pyramids. There are two shorter (2.32 Å) and two longer (2.33 Å) Na-O bond lengths. Ni is bonded in a square co-planar geometry to four equivalent O atoms. All Ni-O bond lengths are 1.91 Å. O is bonded to four equivalent Na and two equivalent Ni atoms to form a mixture of corner and edge-sharing ONa₄Ni₂ octahedra. The corner-sharing octahedral tilt angles range from 0-23°.",
